er Jasper","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_deWkFV":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Juwelier Jasper in Erfurt is an exclusive retailer of Shamballa Jewels, situated in the historic heart of the city. Known for its commitment to exceptional quality and fine craftsmanship, Juwelier Jasper showcases a refined selection of luxury jewelry, including the distinctive Shamballa collection. Visitors are invited to explore our iconic bracelets, necklaces, and rings, each piece crafted to unite spiritual symbolism with luxurious design. With personalized service and an inviting atmosphere, Juwelier Jasper offers a unique destination for discovering Shamballa Jewels' artistry and elegance in Erfurt.<strong><br\/><br\/>Opening hours<\/strong><br\/>Monday-friday: 10:00 - 18:30 Uhr<br\/>Saturday: 10:00 - 18:00 Uhr<br\/>Sunday: Closed<br\/><br\/><a href=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/place\/Juwelier+Jasper+-+Offizieller+Rolex+Fachh%C3%A4ndler\/@50.974866,11.032428,15z\/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47a472bf0f888bcf:0xb795a6dd8354f01e!8m2!3d50.9747561!4d11.0325681!16s%2Fg%2F1tj9sbzm?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI0MTAyMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Juwelier Japser Erfurt\">Anger 28<br\/>D-99084 Erfurt, Germany<\/a><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["caption_a64NDb","heading_6ppfAQ","text_deWkFV"],"custom_css":[".image-with-text__content.image-with-text__content--middle.image-with-text__content--desktop-left.image-with-text__content--mobile-left.image-with-text__content--adapt.content-container.gradient.color-background-1 {background-image: none !important; background-color: #ffffff !important;}"],"settings":{"height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"large","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":36}}},"order":["main","slideshow_D3giif","rich_text_wq3Dd7","ri